<section class="sec"><div class="wrap"><div class="igrid" data-stagger><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/policy-appraisal-representation/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/consult.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/consult-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/consult.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 01</small><h2>Appraisal Clause Representation</h2><span>We serve as the appraiser you name once either side invokes your policy’s appraisal provision.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/homeowner-claim-appraiser/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="802" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 02</small><h2>Homeowner Claim Appraisal</h2><span>Independent valuation for houses, condos and townhomes when the carrier’s estimate won’t cover the repair.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/commercial-hoa-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/townhomes.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/townhomes-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/townhomes.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="795" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 03</small><h2>Commercial &amp; HOA Claim Appraisal</h2><span>Large-loss appraisal for associations, multifamily, retail, office, industrial and church properties.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/hail-roof-damage-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hailroof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hailroof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hailroof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 04</small><h2>Hail &amp; Roof Damage Appraisal</h2><span>Roof, gutter, siding and window hail claims — the most common dispute along the Front Range.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/wind-tornado-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wind.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wind-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wind.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="792" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 05</small><h2>Wind &amp; Tornado Claim Appraisal</h2><span>Downslope windstorms, plains tornadoes and straight-line winds that lift shingles and tear siding.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/snow-load-ice-dam-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/snowroof.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/snowroof-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/snowroof.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 06</small><h2>Snow Load &amp; Ice Dam Appraisal</h2><span>Winter claims: roof collapse, ice dams, frozen pipes and water damage in mountain and metro homes.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/water-pipe-burst-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/water.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/water-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/water.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="912" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 07</small><h2>Water &amp; Burst Pipe Appraisal</h2><span>Sudden water losses from burst pipes, failed supply lines and appliances, including mold-related scope.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/fire-smoke-loss-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/burned.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/burned-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/burned.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 08</small><h2>Fire &amp; Smoke Loss Appraisal</h2><span>Structure fires and smoke contamination: cleaning versus replacement, odor, soot and contents.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/wildfire-claim-appraisal/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/wildfire-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/wildfire.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 09</small><h2>Wildfire Claim Appraisal</h2><span>Total losses and smoke-exposed homes in the wildland-urban interface — Colorado’s signature disaster.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/carrier-estimate-review/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/review.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/review-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/review.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="900" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 10</small><h2>Carrier Estimate Review</h2><span>A line-by-line review of the insurer’s estimate, showing what’s missing and whether appraisal is worth it.</span></span></a><a class="icard rv" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/umpire-neutral-services/"><span class="icard-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/meeting2.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/meeting2-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/meeting2.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="icard-b"><small>Service 11</small><h2>Umpire &amp; Neutral Services</h2><span>Neutral umpire service for appraisal panels across Colorado, with no ties to either side.</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap faq-split"><div class="rv"><p class="kicker">Getting started</p><h2>Most files begin with an estimate review</h2><p>Before anyone invokes appraisal, it helps to know exactly where the carrier’s estimate falls short and what that gap is worth. A review answers that in days, and many disputes close right there.</p><a class="btn btn-navy" href="/colorado-claim-appraisal/carrier-estimate-review/">About estimate reviews <svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a></div><div class="rv"><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I hire you for only part of the process?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Many owners start with an estimate review and decide later whether to invoke appraisal. Others call us after a demand has already been made.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you handle commercial and HOA claims?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Yes — single-family homes, condos and townhomes, multifamily, retail, office, industrial, churches and association-insured buildings.</p></div></details><details><summary>Which perils do you work on?<svg class="chev" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6"/></svg></summary><div class="faq-a"><p>Hail, wind, tornado, wildfire, fire and smoke, snow load and ice dams, frozen and burst pipes, and other covered water losses.</p></div></details></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-par"><img class="cta-img" src="/assets/img/photos/cta.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/cta-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/cta.webp 1200w" sizes="100vw" width="1200" height="798" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-parallax="0.16"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><h2>Have a Colorado claim that doesn’t add up?</h2><p>Send us the carrier’s estimate and your photos. We’ll review them and tell you what we see.</p><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-gold" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line-l" href="/contact-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
